00:09:26.910 --> 00:09:28.233
We need to take these out.

00:09:32.760 --> 00:09:34.170
Oh, look, there's eyes in here.

00:09:34.170 --> 00:09:35.160
It's so weird.

00:09:35.160 --> 00:09:37.503
Do I have to cut off these goggles?

00:09:38.430 --> 00:09:40.062
Oh.

00:09:40.062 --> 00:09:40.983
Oh, look at that.

00:09:42.180 --> 00:09:43.013
Look at that.

00:09:43.013 --> 00:09:44.004
See?

00:09:44.004 --> 00:09:46.110
Sir, can you tilt your
head just a little bit?

00:09:46.110 --> 00:09:48.030
You're really gonna stay
in that direction, huh?

00:09:48.030 --> 00:09:48.863
Oh, no.

00:09:48.863 --> 00:09:49.696
I need you-

00:09:49.696 --> 00:09:50.529
There you go.

00:09:50.529 --> 00:09:51.660
Keep that eye open for me, would you?

00:09:51.660 --> 00:09:53.040
I'm gonna need to gently.

00:09:53.040 --> 00:09:54.960
Oh, dropped the scissors on your laps.

00:09:54.960 --> 00:09:55.950
Sorry about that, sir.

00:09:55.950 --> 00:09:59.253
Let's go with the, like, a
little sharp mini blade here.

00:10:02.130 --> 00:10:05.703
Oh, I left this scalpel
inserted into your eye.

00:10:07.680 --> 00:10:10.770
Okay, it looks like, I think,
I think I got it loose.

00:10:10.770 --> 00:10:11.603
There you go.

00:10:16.473 --> 00:10:17.306
Okay.

00:10:17.306 --> 00:10:18.139
One eye out.

00:10:18.139 --> 00:10:20.040
Sir, can you open up your other eye?

00:10:20.040 --> 00:10:22.470
You wanna make a cut right
at the retinal artery here.

00:10:22.470 --> 00:10:25.050
You wanna shake the person's
head, get the eye loose,

00:10:25.050 --> 00:10:28.413
and then just make some
gentle cuts right at the eye.

00:10:29.310 --> 00:10:30.180
Hanging, there we go.

00:10:30.180 --> 00:10:32.160
Okay, and then basically what you wanna do

00:10:32.160 --> 00:10:34.740
is you wanna empty out spare eyes here.

00:10:34.740 --> 00:10:36.640
I'm assuming these are the right eyes.

00:10:38.310 --> 00:10:40.320
So we're gonna go ahead
and pop those back in.

00:10:40.320 --> 00:10:41.640
Let's get rid of the right eye.

00:10:41.640 --> 00:10:43.110
Oh, actually that was the left eye.

00:10:43.110 --> 00:10:43.960
I messed that up.

00:10:44.850 --> 00:10:45.840
Okay.

00:10:45.840 --> 00:10:46.950
Here we go.

00:10:46.950 --> 00:10:48.480
Let's go ahead and pop that bad boy in.

00:10:48.480 --> 00:10:49.486
What's up!

00:10:49.486 --> 00:10:50.401
Aye!

00:10:50.401 --> 00:10:54.150
(audience cheering and clapping)

00:10:54.150 --> 00:10:55.350
Look at that.

00:10:55.350 --> 00:10:56.183
You see that?

00:10:56.183 --> 00:10:58.500
Those are the eyes I put in for you.

00:10:58.500 --> 00:10:59.760
Pay me your copay.

00:10:59.760 --> 00:11:02.280
I actually did a whole draw my life video

00:11:02.280 --> 00:11:03.750
about my story coming to America.

00:11:03.750 --> 00:11:04.770
Click here to check it out.

00:11:04.770 --> 00:11:06.270
The animations are super fun.

00:11:06.270 --> 00:11:08.821
And as always, stay happy and healthy.

00:11:08.821 --> 00:11:11.404
(upbeat music)

